C. Smith, A. K. Hill and L. Torrente-Murciano. Current and future role of Haber–Bosch ammonia in a carbon-free energy landscape. Energy & Environmental Science 13, 331–344, 2020; first published online 28 December 2019. [Publisher paper and supplement](https://pubs.rsc.org/en-us/content/articlelanding/2020/ee/c9ee02873k) · [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1039/C9EE02873K).

Read the complete analysis and supporting information. Reconstruct the synthesis-loop, hydrogen-production, separation, energy and system assumptions, then test a competing boundary or variable operating case. Distinguish demonstrated evidence, analysis, projected possibilities and later work. This is a full scholarly process analysis, not a generic guarantee about every proposed ammonia technology.

